WEBVTT

00:03:59.636 --> 00:04:02.876
the only industrialized nation
that doesn't offer paid leave.

00:04:02.916 --> 00:04:04.076
Right?

00:04:04.596 --> 00:04:05.756
Affordable childcare.

00:04:05.796 --> 00:04:07.516
We don't have it in this country.

00:04:07.556 --> 00:04:09.676
The average American
gets about 500 dollars

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:11.516
you know, in childcare benefits.

00:04:11.556 --> 00:04:16.276
The average, in industrialized nation,
parent gets 15,000.

00:04:16.316 --> 00:04:20.156
So we are woefully under providing support

00:04:20.156 --> 00:04:22.796
for parents in this country.

00:04:23.516 --> 00:04:24.756
School closures.

00:04:24.796 --> 00:04:28.036
You know, I find that decision
so interesting,

00:04:28.076 --> 00:04:31.196
I want somebody to do,
like an investigative report, right?